<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Hoechst pharmacy merger near completetion.</title>
<headline>Hoechst pharmacy merger near completetion.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoechst South Africa Ltd said on Tuesday it was finalising a transaction which may affect its share price.</p>
<p>The transaction relates to the proposed merger of the pharmaceutical business of Hoechst South Africa and Roussel Laboratories (Pty) Ltd into a joint venture resulting in a majority equity holding by Hoechst South Africa.</p>
<p>Hoechst advised shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in Hoechst shares until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
